{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9a1c85007205deb90effb5f06ed674239d53435c7ce20c3fa7592d69887d8cb", "ja": "（ふぅ。外回りはこれで落ち着いたな。劇場に戻ったら\n事務作業の続きを……ん？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（呼……外出办事总算告一段落了。回剧场后继续处理文书工作……嗯？那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2525d8be4d9b16ccb53a77e9536a34601efcac877dab4181fbaf7018cc83cfac", "ja": "未来、こんなところで何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "未来，你怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "d1effb8087a3955d0fe52b8282b023165bcfb6225ff87a97756a041fb14410cc", "ja": "うーん……あ、{$P$}さん！\nいいお天気だったので、桜を見に来たんです。", "zh": "嗯……啊，{$P$}先生！\n今天天气很好，所以我就来看樱花了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "fa6c56318c45e02f531c50668d76bb16975e8bcd71497b16d17cad3a75932248", "ja": "でもこの桜、ちょっと変な感じがして……。\n{$P$}さんもそう思いませんか？", "zh": "不过，这棵樱花树总觉得有点奇怪……。\n{$P$}先生也这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2ed7b5eefd32b43608733be9f8a43c56d9f42c37b7cee00ca4c29a3426fafcc3", "ja": "……すまん。俺には普通に綺麗な桜に見えるよ。\n未来は、どこが変だと思うんだ？", "zh": "……抱歉。在我看来就是开得很漂亮的普通樱花啊。\n未来觉得是哪里奇怪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c31dbc0dd13debdaeb9fae0dc5b4d07890d58a6d41df879b20cf79e9c9006c5", "ja": "うーん……なんか、物足りないっていうか……。\nこの前見た夜の桜は、すっごくキレイだったのに。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得，好像少了点什么……明明之前看到的夜樱特别漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1006_p", "source_sha256": "345f51f3e812187c5622ca9e40bbcbe479a3dc3ff814ad2c0c162761400dbb6d", "ja": "この前……ああ、桜の下でライブをした時のことか。\n確かに、あの日は特別、綺麗に見えたな。", "zh": "上次……啊，是在樱花树下举办演唱会那次吧。  \n确实，那天的樱花看起来格外漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e0a571ba5cac7b5e551a7b1fe77bf03825b231704c1410ba6ae26a7eb36bae6", "ja": "ああっ！　それですよ、特別！\nあの日は、お昼のライブがすっごく楽しくて……。", "zh": "啊！就是那个，特别的感觉！\n那天中午的演出特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "f98736a4e049b7611fe0c947590e0899e3662f7d14cb66e36aea427f9f388c27", "ja": "その後のお花見も、ずーっと楽しくて幸せで。\nだから、桜もキラキラして見えたんですね！", "zh": "那之后的赏樱也一直都特别开心、特别幸福。\n所以，连樱花看起来都在闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b36990a5923c2c9ebc2e3ef78890327d90908185c928975e0282687a0005743f", "ja": "なるほど。この前は特別で、今日は\nなんでもない日だから、少し物足りないってことか。", "zh": "原来如此。因为上次很特别，而今天只是平平常常的一天，所以觉得有点不过瘾啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba2903653e0cd34009f37239f4d8b7ac4aec490b3dc6bcdc3353e3fe1fecb5bc", "ja": "はい！　あと、あの日と違うことといえば……\nあ、{$P$}さんもですね！", "zh": "是的！还有，要说和那天不同的地方嘛……\n啊，{$P$}先生也是呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb62003e7cd7857e6a4d340f573c461b7a9fe8d1a02227da2a3a1e4b3305ba91", "ja": "ふたりでお花見ができたから、特別だったのかなって。\nあの時、とってもとーっても幸せだったから。", "zh": "因为我们两个人一起赏了花，所以才会觉得特别吧。因为那时候，我真的真的特别幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba7b98e63c9df1fd141c69aff8d7667e8fd092d462d761ed6ed5b76a455e399d", "ja": "きっと、ライブと{$P$}さん、\n両方、必要だったんです！　あー、スッキリした！", "zh": "一定是因为演唱会和{$P$}先生，两样都不可或缺！啊——想通了，真痛快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1013_p", "source_sha256": "96a787a9d2fe1987d174e467284148d30d527a48861e580925c34e90ec941033", "ja": "はは、必要としてもらえて嬉しいよ。\nそれじゃあ、今日もふたりでお花見するか！", "zh": "哈哈，能被你需要，我很开心。\n那么，今天也要两个人一起去赏花吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "86c89fda73a3d15f8e4ea104e8d46448c5f874bbebde97ffd25ac70673a44e3c", "ja": "えっ、本当ですかっ！？　わ～いっ！\nお花見といえば、やっぱりお団子ですよね！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？好耶——！\n说到赏花，果然还是要吃团子呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0403_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "0ed3a34860a5f23eaf805f24ef174cd3ebf81bea8605ad246f07e88633d4d8a4", "ja": "あの日食べたお団子、とってもおいしかったから、\nまた食べたいな～、なんて。でへへ♪", "zh": "那天吃到的团子真的很好吃，\n好想再吃一次呀～什么的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
